@@ -15,3 +15,23 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Cross-document transitions
+
+The shared layout uses native cross-document view transitions. Critical CSS stays
+in the head, and each page must include exactly one hidden
+`<span id="initial-view-ready" hidden></span>` immediately after its initial
+visible content. The head's `rel="expect"` link waits for that checkpoint to be
+parsed, without waiting for the rest of a long article or its footer.
+
+The initial UI is server-rendered; React hydration adds interaction without
+establishing the initial layout. If a page needs JavaScript to set its initial
+theme or layout, pass its script URLs through the layout's `criticalScripts`
+prop. These scripts run from the head with `async blocking="render"`; keep them
+small and independent, and do not use this prop for analytics, ads, or other
+non-critical work. Render blocking waits for script execution, not asynchronous
+work launched by a script.
+
+Reduced-motion preferences disable transitions. Unsupported browsers use normal
+document navigation. The parsing checkpoint does not wait for image downloads
+or decoding.
